{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/android' data-target='computer\/os\/android' data-title='Android'>\r\n\t\t\tAndroid\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb' data-title='ADB'>\r\n\t\t\tADB\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Put adbd on TCP port 5555, connect over WiFi, and switch back to USB.","label":"ADB WiFi","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_path","label":"ADB path","url":"\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_path"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/android\/adb\/freeze_background","label":"Freeze background","url":"\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/freeze_background"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRun ADB over WiFi after USB debugging is working. Default TCP port is 5555.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Setup<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Download and install the Google USB driver from SDK Manager.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Install the vendor-specific driver.<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div>Enable USB debugging on the device.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>Connect<\/h2>\n\t<h4>SU<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOn a rooted device:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>su\nsetprop service.adb.tcp.port 5555\nstop adbd\nstart adbd<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Non-SU<\/h4>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Connect via USB and list devices:<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>adb devices<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Restart ADB on the client (debugger) in TCP mode. Default port is 5555. Compulsory on Mac:<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>adb tcpip [port]\nadb tcpip 5555<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIt should say restarting in TCPIP mode. Another program using ADB, like Android Studio, should not be running.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Disconnect USB.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Reconnect to ADB on WiFi. Example IP <code class='inline'>192.168.1.31<\/code>. Default port is 5555:<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>adb connect &lt;IP&gt;[:port]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Reconnect on USB<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>adb usb<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>kill-server<\/code> if ADB is already running.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Backup<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>backup -f ~\/data.ab -noapk app.package.name<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_wifi\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_wifi\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_path' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb\/adb_path' data-title='ADB path' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>ADB path<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb\/freeze_background' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb\/freeze_background' data-title='Freeze background' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Freeze background<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/adb' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/adb' data-title='ADB'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>ADB<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}